:edl.

:h1 res=007.Advice and strategy
:font facename=Helv size=8x12.
:p.
The house has an advantage in both variants; the best strategy is to play small. The Advice button follows these rules&colon.
:ul.
:li.A pair or better&colon. bet. In Draw it also marks the cards to throw away.
:li.Stud with Ace/King&colon. bet only if you hold a card equal to the dealer's face up card; otherwise fold.
:li.Draw with four cards to a flush or a straight&colon. bet and throw away the odd card.
:li.Anything else&colon. fold.
:eul.

:h1 res=008.Menus and keys
:font facename=Helv size=8x12.
:p.
Game&colon. New Game, Stud, Draw, Exit. Cash&colon. Add $100, Cash Out. Options&colon. Sound switches the sound effects; Language selects English, Spanish, Dutch, German, French or Italian, and menus, dialogs and this help change at once; Save settings on exit stores the settings, the bank and the jackpot in CPoker.cfg.
:p.
Keys&colon.
:dl tsize=10.
:dt.:hp2.A:ehp2.
:dd.Ante
:dt.:hp2.B:ehp2.
:dd.Bet
:dt.:hp2.F:ehp2.
:dd.Fold
:dt.:hp2.V:ehp2.
:dd.Advice
:dt.:hp2.P:ehp2.
:dd.Progressive chip
:dt.:hp2.F1:ehp2.
:dd.Help
:dt.:hp2.Ctrl+N:ehp2.
:dd.New Game&colon. sets the bank to $100
:dt.:hp2.Ctrl+X:ehp2.
:dd.Exit
:dt.:hp2.Ctrl+F:ehp2.
:dd.Frame Controls&colon. hides or shows the title bar and menu
:edl.

:h1 res=009.About Caribbean Poker and license
:font facename=Helv size=8x12.
:p.
Caribbean Poker is part of The Compulsive Gambler's Toolkit by IglooSoft (1999), released as open source in 2002. The program was unfinished in the original; the Open Watcom version in C was completed by the OS2World community in 2026.
:p.
Caribbean Poker is free software&colon. you can redistribute it and/or modify it under the terms of the GNU General Public License as published by the Free Software Foundation, either version 3 of the License or (at your option) any later version. It is distributed in the hope that it will be useful, but WITHOUT ANY WARRANTY. See the file LICENSE.txt.

:euserdoc.
